# #220: the new arm64 jobs and the cross-arch identity check, recorded from this pull request's CI run
# (vhs demo/arm64-ci.tape from the repository root, after saving the run summary as $PROOF).
Output demo/arm64-ci.gif
Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1400
Set Height 600
Set TypingSpeed 20ms

Hide
Type "export PS1='$ ' && clear" Enter
Show

Type "cat $PROOF" Enter
Sleep 12s
